Package: mlvtoolbox
Type: Package
Title: Contour Geometry and Mid-Level Vision Analysis
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analyses vectorized line drawings using contour orientation, length,
    curvature, junctions, and average-outward-flux medial-axis representations.
    Includes image tracing, stimulus manipulation, reproducible feature tables,
    and explicit handling of degenerate geometry. Implements methods described
    by Walther et al. (2023) <doi:10.3389/fcomp.2023.1140723>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: Rcpp, graphics, grDevices, stats, utils, tools
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), xml2, png, jpeg, R.matlab, knitr, rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
SystemRequirements: C++17
